Close all outgoing channels except the one to @RELAY@. Scriptable and
non-interactive -- the node key signs via the Safe's module, and blokli does the
reads and the broadcast:

  sudo -E ./tools/close-channels.py --keep @RELAY@          # plan only
  sudo -E ./tools/close-channels.py --keep @RELAY@ --send   # do it
  sudo -E ./tools/close-channels.py --finalize --send       # after the grace period

No RPC endpoint and no contract address to look up: BLOKLI_URL (default
https://blokli.jura.hoprnet.link) is the only endpoint. Set the allowlist FIRST
so the strategy does not reopen what you close. No new identity, no faucet code;
stakes return to the Safe. Verify with --count before running a study.
